      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5de9405aea7cc52772fcc359|full_name}: I now have:\nAssets/Samples/VRChat SDK - Avatars/3.0.9/\nAssets/Samples/VRChat SDK - Avatars/3.1.1/\nPackages/VRChat SDK - Avatars/Samples/\nSeems to have destroyed all references to the default proxy animations within my custom locomotion. The GUIDs of the sample files probably got regenerated due to conflicts during migration to embedded package this update.\nGonna remove the SDK, Samples folder, and my locomotion and manually reassign every animation clip with hopefully the original asset GUIDs in tact from fresh import.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
