      "value": "@{5d101e50428ccc1668e70d7c|full_name}: Let me know if removing the Samples folders first fixes the issue for you. Your thoughts about conflicting GUIDs makes sense. I'm not sure on the best way forward for this case, though - I don't think we want to automatically delete the Samples folder since people may have made changes they want to keep in there, so it may require a warning and instructions on how to do it manually.",
